OHOS: translate the document-picker/file-export error strings this port adds to
ScreenshotController.

Screenshots and recognition results are saved through an OHOS document-picker
authorization instead of a plain file path (see the userfileexportqueue and
screenshotcontroller patches), so this adds translations for that flow's
user-facing messages. The DirectCaptureController capture-failure strings, the
Impl's Finder-automation prompts and the MCP endpoint messages that the
unpatched catalog already carries are untouched: OHOS reuses those existing
translations and does not build the MCP server or a Finder integration.

